  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:\r\nnone;text-autospace:none&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Arial Nova Light&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Officers consider the proposed development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Arial Nova Light&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;would result in a substandard\r\nlevel amenity for the proposed units owing to their location within an\r\nundercroft thereby resulting in notably poor outlook and privacy for the\r\nintended occupants contrary to NPPF para 130 (f), and Merton Local Plan policy\r\nD12.3 (g).&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:\r\nnone;text-autospace:none&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Arial Nova Light&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;In the absence of a legal agreement securing an affordable housing contribution\r\nthe proposal would be contrary to Merton Local Plan policy H11.1 &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:\r\nnone;text-autospace:none&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Arial Nova Light&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:\r\nnone;text-autospace:none&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Arial Nova Light&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Arial Nova Light&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;In the absence of a legal agreement securing a carbon offset, the\r\ndevelopment would be contrary to Merton Local Plan policy CC2.2.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:\r\nnone;text-autospace:none&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Arial Nova Light&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;It has come to the attention of Officers that the application is invalid\r\nas it has been accompanied by an incorrect Ownership Certificate. The applicant\r\nhas completed Certificate A, which may only be used where the applicant is the sole\r\nowner of all the land to which the application relates. However, the available\r\ninformation indicates that the applicant is not the sole owner, and therefore Certificate\r\nB should have been completed and the required notice served on all other owners.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:\r\nnone;text-autospace:none&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Arial Nova Light&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Under Articles 13 and 14 of the Town &amp;amp; Country Planning\r\n(Development Management Procedure) Order 2015, and Section 65(5) of the Town\r\nand Country Planning Act 1990.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:\r\nnone;text-autospace:none&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Arial Nova Light&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;As the correct certificate has not been provided and the required\r\nnotices have not been served on the other landowner(s), the application cannot\r\nproceed and is therefore refused on grounds of invalidity.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
